OL,3,GNEWSAItems from Ann Widdecombe's estate
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FItems from the estate of Ann Widdecombe
OL,7,Fis set to go up for auction next month.
OL,9,FThe former MP was found dead at her
OL,10,Fhome in Haytor, Devon, on 9 July and a
OL,11,F28-year-old man from Rotherham, South
OL,12,FYorkshire was charged with her murder.
OL,14,FA number of items, which belonged to
OL,15,Fthe 78-year-old former Conservative
OL,16,Fminister turned Reform UK spokeswoman,
OL,17,Fare due to be auctioned off as part of
OL,18,Fthe three-day event at Whittons
OL,19,FAuctions in Honiton, Devon, from 2
OL,20,FDecember. They include items from her
OL,21,Ftime in government and her television
OL,22,Fcareer.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
