OL,3,GNEWSAItems from Ann Widdecombe's estate
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaria Whitton, director of Whittons
OL,7,FAuctions, said it was a "privilege" to
OL,8,Fbe entrusted with the estate, adding it
OL,9,Fhas received interest from "around the
OL,10,Fworld".
